<%- include('partials/header') %>
<h1 class="page-title">How it works</h1>
<div class="grid" style="grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fill,minmax(240px,1fr))">
  <div class="card"><div class="price" style="font-size:30px">1</div><div class="svc-title">Choose your service</div><p class="muted small">Pick the model or unlock type you need.</p></div>
  <div class="card"><div class="price" style="font-size:30px">2</div><div class="svc-title">Enter your IMEI or Serial</div><p class="muted small">Dial *#06# or find it in Settings → General → About.</p></div>
  <div class="card"><div class="price" style="font-size:30px">3</div><div class="svc-title">Pay with USDT</div><p class="muted small">Send the exact amount via TRC20 or ERC20. It confirms automatically in minutes.</p></div>
  <div class="card"><div class="price" style="font-size:30px">4</div><div class="svc-title">Get your result</div><p class="muted small">We process your order and you'll see the result in your account.</p></div>
</div>
<div class="panel" style="margin-top:24px">
  <h3 style="margin-top:0">Frequently asked questions</h3>
  <div class="kv" style="display:block;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border);padding:12px 0">
    <strong>What is USDT?</strong>
    <p class="muted small" style="margin:6px 0 0">It's a stablecoin pegged to the US dollar (1 USDT ≈ 1 USD). You can buy it on Binance, Kraken or any exchange and pay from your wallet.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="kv" style="display:block;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border);padding:12px 0">
    <strong>Which network should I choose, TRC20 or ERC20?</strong>
    <p class="muted small" style="margin:6px 0 0">TRC20 (TRON) has lower fees and is the most used. ERC20 (Ethereum) also works. Always send on the network you selected.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="kv" style="display:block;padding:12px 0">
    <strong>How long does it take?</strong>
    <p class="muted small" style="margin:6px 0 0">It depends on the service: from instant up to 24 hours. The estimated time is shown on each service.</p>
  </div>
</div>
<%- include('partials/footer') %>
